'''Wartime Burial''' (戦地直葬, ''Senchichokusō'', '''Battlefield Burial''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 14.5 Update|Version 14.5]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 3.

==Effect==
"Strengthen" Effect UP (Sm): Strengthen Up buff increases by 20%.

